## 4. Approval Insufficient-Evidence Gate Path

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> ApprovalGates_Loading: EVENT_NAV_APPROVAL_GATES
    ApprovalGates_Loading --> ApprovalGates_Default: EVENT_API_APPROVAL_GATES_SUCCESS
    ApprovalGates_Loading --> ApprovalGates_Empty: EVENT_API_APPROVAL_GATES_EMPTY
    ApprovalGates_Loading --> ApprovalGates_Error: EVENT_API_APPROVAL_GATES_ERROR
    ApprovalGates_Loading --> ApprovalGates_PermissionDenied: EVENT_PERMISSION_DENIED
    ApprovalGates_Loading --> ApprovalGates_InsufficientEvidence: EVENT_API_APPROVAL_EVIDENCE_INSUFFICIENT

    state ApprovalGates_InsufficientEvidence {
        [*] --> Evidence_Readiness_Summary
        Evidence_Readiness_Summary --> Approve_Disabled: invalid_reasons present
        Approve_Disabled --> Reason_Tooltip: approve_disabled_reason = api.approval.evidence.invalid_reasons[0]
        Evidence_Readiness_Summary --> Refresh_CTA: ds:webui.approval.refresh_evidence_button visible
        Evidence_Readiness_Summary --> Reject_Available: reject_enabled = permissions.can_reject
        Evidence_Readiness_Summary --> Admin_Override_Form: permissions.is_admin
    }

    ApprovalGates_InsufficientEvidence --> ApprovalGates_Loading: EVENT_approval_refresh_evidence
    ApprovalGates_InsufficientEvidence --> ApprovalGates_Writing: EVENT_approval_reject_request
    ApprovalGates_InsufficientEvidence --> ApprovalGates_PermissionDenied: EVENT_approval_approve_request_DENIED
    ApprovalGates_Default --> ApprovalGates_InsufficientEvidence: EVENT_EVIDENCE_BECOMES_INVALID
    ApprovalGates_Default --> ApprovalGates_Writing: EVENT_approval_approve_request
    ApprovalGates_Default --> ApprovalGates_PermissionDenied: EVENT_approval_manual_override_DENIED
    ApprovalGates_Default --> ApprovalGates_Writing: EVENT_approval_manual_override
    ApprovalGates_Writing --> ApprovalGates_Default: EVENT_API_WRITE_SUCCESS
    ApprovalGates_Writing --> ApprovalGates_Error: EVENT_API_WRITE_ERROR
    ApprovalGates_Writing --> Shell_Offline: EVENT_WRITE_OFFLINE_QUEUED
```

## 5. Approval Action Bindings and Guards

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    Streams["Required evidence streams\ntest_results\ncode_diff\nbeads_id\nprd_requirements\ngithub_pr_ci_status"]
    Statuses["stream_statuses + invalid_reasons\nds:webui.approval.evidence_status_summary"]
    Complete{"api.approval.evidence.is_complete"}
    CanApprove{"permissions.can_approve"}
    CanReject{"permissions.can_reject"}
    IsAdmin{"permissions.is_admin\naudit_reason length >= 12"}

    Streams --> Statuses --> Complete
    Complete -- false --> Insufficient["ApprovalGates_InsufficientEvidence"]
    Complete -- true --> CanApprove
    CanApprove -- true --> Approve["approval.approve_request\nds:webui.approval.approve_button\nPUT /api/tasks/:id"]
    CanApprove -- false --> ApproveDenied["Approve disabled or denied\ntooltip = invalid_reasons[0]"]

    Insufficient --> DisabledReason["approve_disabled_reason\napi.approval.evidence.invalid_reasons[0]"]
    Insufficient --> Refresh["approval.refresh_evidence\nds:webui.approval.refresh_evidence_button\nEVENT_approval_refresh_evidence"]
    Insufficient --> CanReject
    CanReject -- true --> Reject["approval.reject_request\nds:webui.approval.reject_button\nPUT /api/tasks/:id"]
    CanReject -- false --> RejectDisabled["Reject disabled"]

    Statuses --> IsAdmin
    IsAdmin -- true --> Override["approval.manual_override\nds:webui.approval.admin_override_form\naudit reason required"]
    IsAdmin -- false --> OverrideDenied["EVENT_approval_manual_override_DENIED"]
```

## 6. RTE Escalation Badge Entry Points and States

