    SafeBoard_Writing --> SafeBoard_Default: EVENT_API_WRITE_SUCCESS
    SafeBoard_Writing --> SafeBoard_Error: EVENT_API_WRITE_ERROR
    SafeBoard_Writing --> SafeBoard_Offline: EVENT_WRITE_OFFLINE_QUEUED
```

